{
  "_readme": [
    "MOON WARS — drawn art overrides.",
    "",
    "Every sprite in this game is DRAWN IN CODE by js/assets.js, and that",
    "stays the floor: the game must boot with no image files at all.",
    "A file listed here OVERRIDES the generated sprite of the same name;",
    "anything not listed keeps the one the code draws. Art can therefore",
    "arrive one icon at a time.",
    "",
    "To add a picture:",
    "  1. drop art/<name>.png  (<name> is the sprite name, e.g. icon_medbay)",
    "  2. add \"<name>\" to the sprites list below",
    "",
    "Leave the list empty and the game looks exactly as it does today.",
    "A name listed with no file behind it is not an error either — the",
    "generated sprite simply stays.",
    "",
    "Sprite names in use: ship_player ship_enemy ship_boss crew_player",
    "crew_engineer crew_soldier crew_enemy icon_shields icon_weapons",
    "icon_engines icon_oxygen icon_medbay icon_piloting room_default",
    "room_shields room_weapons room_engines room_oxygen room_medbay",
    "room_piloting proj_laser proj_missile proj_cannon particles",
    "ui_panels bg_stars bg_moon shield_ring bar_sprites elevator",
    "",
    "HULLS (update116): hull_<layout>.png (flown by you) and",
    "hull_<layout>_enemy.png (flown at you) are PAINTED by",
    "tools/gen_hull_art.js from the geometry in js/ship.js and listed",
    "here by it. A hull picture must be exactly the size of its box",
    "(hullArtGeometry) or the game ignores it and draws the plate in code.",
    "ROOFS (update118): hull_<layout>_roof.png and",
    "hull_<layout>_enemy_roof.png, the same box, painted by the same",
    "script: the closed hull shown in the base and during a jump.",
    "Change a layout -> run:  node tools/gen_hull_art.js",
    "",
    "MODULES (update119): room_<type>.png (room_default.png = an empty",
    "bay), 100x50 = a room under its duct, painted by",
    "tools/gen_room_art.js. The tiles js/assets.js draws for the same",
    "names stay the fallback.",
    "Each module again in every yard's colours (update120):",
    "room_<type>_<yard>.png, room_default_<yard>.png — the game takes the",
    "yard's own first."
  ],
